<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">Our stockholders ratified
the appointment of CohnReznick LLP as our independent auditors for the fiscal year ending December 31, 2025, by the following votes:</p>

