<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><b>Proposal 3 &#8211; Approval of Reverse Stock
Split</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">Our stockholders approved
an amendment to our certificate of incorporation to effect a reverse stock split at a ratio not less than 1:10 and not more than 1:30
(the &#8220;Reverse Stock Split&#8221;), such ratio and the implementation and timing of such Reverse Stock Split to be determined in
the discretion of our board of directors by the following votes:</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

