<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><b>Proposal 4 &#8211; Approval of Warrant Exercise</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">Our stockholders approved,
for the purposes of complying with Nasdaq Listing Rule 5635(d), the issuance of shares of common stock underlying (x) series F warrants
(the &#8220;Series F Warrants&#8221;) and (y) warrants (the &#8220;Wainwright Warrants,&#8221; and together with the Series F Warrants,
the &#8220;Warrants&#8221;) issued to H.C. Wainwright &amp; Co., LLC (&#8220;Wainwright&#8221;), pursuant to that certain Securities Purchase
Agreement, dated March 6, 2025, and the investors named therein, and that certain Engagement Letter, dated as of October 9, 2024, by and
between the Company and Wainwright, respectively, in an amount equal to 20% or more of our common stock outstanding before the issuance
of such Warrants by the following votes:</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

